# Licensing — cloudpdf.com

This package is the source of the CloudPDF website. It carries four licensing
zones:

| Zone                                                | Paths                                                                   | License                                                                              |
| --------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Site application code                               | everything not listed below                                             | [Apache-2.0](../../LICENSE)                                                          |
| Documentation prose                                 | `src/content/docs/`                                                     | [CC-BY-4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)                            |
| Code samples                                        | code blocks inside the docs                                             | [MIT-0](https://opensource.org/license/mit-0) — copy freely, no attribution required |
| Articles & blog posts, logos, brand & design assets | everything else under `src/content/`, brand imagery wherever it appears | © CloudPDF LTD, all rights reserved                                                  |

"EmbedPDF" and "CloudPDF" are brand names of CloudPDF LTD; no license in this
repository grants trademark rights.
